  "limitations": [
    "The 2003 facade and the later visitor photograph establish the cutaway shape and bowl. Model dimensions, exact seating, signage and small trim are estimates.",
    "The court scales the approximate 28 m basketball length at 1:25. Other dimensions are interpreted from the photographs.",
    "The exhibit center, orientation and current display condition are pending. The photos show the miniature’s cutaway, and the available PMTiles lack a separate footprint or exhibit point.",
    "The overhead photo shows three dark openings in the lower seating. Their azimuths follow the painted court in the photograph. Widths and depths are estimates.",
    "The 2003 entrance photo shows gridded window strips, blue barred doors and low planting beds along the two wings. The model interprets the scale and spacing of these details.",
    "The fitted position and bearing represent November 2011. Elevation is based on retained terrain. The current display condition is unverified."
  ]
